nd adjusting trim near the driver’s seat (not assembling the seat).\n- **Frames 19–22**: Final inspection, washing, and presentation of the completed car.\n\n---\n\n### Conclusion:\nThe provided frames focus on **engine installation, electrical systems, chassis assembly, and final interior/exterior detailing**. The **assembly of car seats — including joining front/back sections, using specific tools, or securing methods — is not shown** in any of the 22 frames. The documentary appears to skip the seat manufacturing or assembly process entirely, likely because it occurs off-camera or in a different facility not featured in these clips.'}], 'formatted_responses': ['\n=== Batch 0-22 (22 frames) ===\nFrames: /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_0390.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_0395.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_0400.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_0405.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_0410.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_0415.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_0420.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_0425.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_0430.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_1660.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_1665.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_1670.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_1675.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_1680.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_1685.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_1690.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_2685.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos